{"spread": 15, "blocks": [[{"t": "You don\u2019t always see it coming\u2014the moment you realise ", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Medium", "size": 20.0, "color": "#FFFFFF", "bbox": [94, 246, 642, 274]}, {"t": "you\u2019ve helped build something bigger than yourself.", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Medium", "size": 20.0, "color": "#FFFFFF", "bbox": [94, 270, 599, 298]}], [{"t": "For Shan Nathan, that moment didn\u2019t arrive with a ", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Medium", "size": 20.0, "color": "#FFFFFF", "bbox": [124, 318, 609, 346]}], [{"t": "fancy title or a corner office. It crept in quietly ", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Medium", "size": 20.0, "color": "#FFFFFF", "bbox": [143, 342, 598, 370]}], [{"t": "between site walks, sleepless nights, and one ", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Medium", "size": 20.0, "color": "#FFFFFF", "bbox": [154, 366, 598, 394]}], [{"t": "particularly wild post-rebrand project that tested ", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Medium", "size": 20.0, "color": "#FFFFFF", "bbox": [161, 390, 647, 418]}], [{"t": "everything Mint had just declared itself to be.", "font": "SpaceGrotesk-Medium", "size": 20.0, "color": "#FFFFFF", "bbox": [170, 414, 614, 442]}], [{"t": "TO STRATEGY ", "font": "Roboto-Bold", "size": 83.0, "color": "#9BD9E5", "bbox": [48, 53, 634, 163]}], [{"t": "ROOM", "font": "Roboto-Bold", "size": 83.0, "color": "#9BD9E5", "bbox": [363, 133, 612, 243]}]]}